# Converted SDK manuals under system-docs/md/ are generated by gen-docs.bat from the
# PDFs alongside them. Mark them as generated so GitHub collapses them in diffs and
# does not count them toward the repository's language statistics, and suppress the
# textual diff so `git diff` never dumps a megabyte of reference material.
system-docs/md/** linguist-generated=true
system-docs/md/** -diff

# Windows batch files must keep CRLF endings.
*.bat text eol=crlf
